><option>Reels &amp; short storytelling</option><option>Video editing</option></select></label><label class="mt-5 block text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#aab8cc]">A little about your project <span class="text-[#7de7f1]">*</span><textarea name="message" required="" minlength="8" rows="5" class="input-field mt-2 resize-y" placeholder="What are you making, and what would a good outcome look like?" data-testid="input-contact-message"></textarea></label><button class="button-primary mt-5 w-full" type="submit" data-testid="button-submit-contact">OPEN EMAIL DRAFT <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-send" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"></path><path d="m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939"></path></svg></button><p class="mt-3 text-center text-[10px] leading-5 text-[#71819a]">This opens your email app with a prepared draft. Nothing is sent automatically.</p></form><aside class="reveal flex flex-col justify-between gap-8"><div><p class="eyebrow">DIRECT LINE</p><a href="mailto:hello@saurabhmondal.com" class="group mt-4 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 py-4 text-[14px] text-[#dbe5f3] transition hover:text-[#7de7f1]" data-testid="link-contact-email"><span class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail text-[#76e5ef]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7"></path><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect></svg>hello@saurabhmondal.com</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right text-[#7588a4] group-hover:text-[#7de7f1]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><p class="mt-5 text-[12px] leading-6 text-[#8291a8]">For a quick hello, a project brief, or a good question. I read every note.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/[.08] bg-[#0b172a]/55 p-5"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] tracking-[.2em] text-[#7f91ac]">AVAILABLE FOR</p><p class="display mt-3 text-[17px] font-semibold text-[#e6edf8]">Thoughtful projects.<br>Good people.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] tracking-[.12em] text-[#8fa0b7]"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#77e7f1]"></span> OPEN TO NEW COLLABORATIONS</span></div></aside></div></div></section></main><footer class="border-t border-white/[.07] py-7"><div class="shell flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center"><a href="https://a0b55526-a1c1-4b1b-a4ba-3863414eda38-00-1vbw78e7upz75.pike.replit.dev/?nativeBrowserPresentationStyle=fullScreen#top" class="display text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[.12em] text-[#cad6e8]">SAURABH MONDAL<span class="text-[#77e7f1]">.</span></a><p class="text-[10px] text-[#6f7f97]">Independent creative Â· Ideas in motion</p><a href="https://a0b55526-a1c1-4b1b-a4ba-3863414eda38-00-1vbw78e7upz75.pike.replit.dev/?nativeBrowserPresentationStyle=fullScreen#top" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] text-[#90a0b8] hover:text-[#7de7f1]">BACK TO TOP <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-down rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"></path><path d="m19 12-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></a></div></footer></div></div>
    
  

